            "relation": "USED_IN_EXPERIMENT",
            "target_entity_instance": "ssp245-GHG",
            "target_entity_type": "Experiment",
            "paragraph": "Specifically, four models which provide both the historical aerosol-only (hist-aer) and GHG-only (hist-GHG) simulations for 1850\u20132020, as well as their respective future scenarios (ssp245-aer and ssp245-GHG) for 2021\u20132100, are used. They are CanESM5, GISS-E2-1-G, MIROC6, and NorESM2-LM.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "GISS-E2-1-G",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "ASSOCIATED_WITH_MEMBER",
            "target_entity_instance": "r1i1p1f2",
            "target_entity_type": "Member",
            "paragraph": "For consistency, only the first ensemble member from each model (r1i1p1f2 for GISS-E2-1-G and r1i1p1f1 for the others) is used for the common period 1920\u20132080 for a direct comparison among the simulations. Although one ensemble member from each model is utilized to avoid overpresentation of models with larger ensembles, the results do not change significantly when all available ensemble members are used.",
